    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How to use KRL",
     "texto": [
      "**KRL** are the initials of **Kereta Rel Listrik**, the electric commuter train. The instructions usually order the steps with **pertama** (\"first\") and **kemudian** (\"then\")."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Safety rules",
     "texto": [
      "**Dilarang membawa senjata tajam** is a formal notice. **Jangan membawa senjata tajam** is addressed directly to the person. The verb doesn't change depending on who receives the instruction."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
